  "note": "How many members sit on a county's governing body, read from each state's own law. A state listed here gives every county the size its law sets for a county without a charter of its own; a county whose own charter has been read keeps that charter's size. A state not listed has not been read, and its counties take the national average below. Under municipalCodes, a place whose county-equivalents are governed as municipalities under its own municipal code gives each a mayor and a legislature at the size that code sets. A state whose law sets the size by population lists bands; the county's population is the Bureau of Economic Analysis 2024 count (data/research/money/public-budget-bases.json).",
